{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19715","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 一 · 吕温","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐视轻神宝，传归属圣猷。\n尧功终有待，文德本无忧。\n坐受朝汾水，行看告岱丘。\n那知鼎成後，龙驭弗淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}